<title>USA: U.S. soybean weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. soybean weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA soybean export sales highlights in latest reporting week:</p>
<p>Net sales of 141,200 MT were off 41 percent from the previous week and 54 percent from the 4-week average.</p>
<p>The major increases were for Japan (65,100 MT), Mexico (20,100 MT), and Turkey (20,000 MT).</p>
<p>Exports of 413,700 MT were two and one-fifth times the previous week's level and 17 percent above the 4-week average.</p>
<p>The primary destinations were Japan (122,900 MT), Taiwan (113,400 MT), and South Korea (59,100 MT).</p>
</text>
